    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. so if the issue is the crystallization/structure not being stable, what's the exact temperature curve i should be aiming for? like, what are the specific stages for dark chocolate so i can make sure those crystals set right?",
      "source": "evaluator"
